    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`nemsServer` is the development messaging server module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for dev-scoped EMS/NEMS server activation and runtime topology. Messaging behavior and provider adapters belong in the messaging modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Server configuration should preserve provider governance, diagnostics, and layered overrides."
    }
